<title>UK: Emess Q1 sales ahead of last year.</title>
<headline>Emess Q1 sales ahead of last year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British lighting company Emess Plc said on Thursday that sales in the first quarter were ahead of last year.</p>
<p>&quot;Our consumer lighting companies continue to make excellent progress in the UK and USA,&quot; chairman Michael Meyer told shareholders at the company's annual general meeting (AGM).</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
